{title: Create In Me A Clean Heart}
{artist: Gilberto Barreto}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 73}

VERSE 1
[G]Make me know [D/F#]you, O [Em]Lord [Em/D]
[C]In the [Am]depths of my [C/D]soul. [D]
Puri-[G]fy me [D/F#]and I will be [Em]clean. [Em/D]
[C]Wash me [Am]whiter than [C/D]snow. [D]

CHORUS
[C]Create in [D]me a [B]clean heart, O [Em]God
[C]And renew your [D]Spirit with-[G]in me.[G7]
[C]Create in [D]me a [B]clean heart, O [Em]God
[C]And renew your [D]Spirit with-[G]in me.

VERSE 2
The [G]sacrifices [D/F#] ac-[Em]ceptable to [Em/D]you,
O [C]Lord, are a [Am]broken [C/D]spirit. [D]
A [G]broken heart,[D/F#] a [Em]contrite heart,[Em/D]
O [C]God, you [Am]will not de-[C/D]spise. [D]

CHORUS
[C]Create in [D]me a [B]clean heart, O [Em]God
[C]And renew your [D]Spirit with-[G]in me.[G7]
[C]Create in [D]me a [B]clean heart, O [Em]God
